<article class="env-definition" id="06GY">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/06GY">Definition <span data-tag="06GY">90.3.6</span>.</a> Let $R \to S$ be a local homomorphism of local rings. The <em>relative cotangent space</em><a class="footnotemark" href="#a0001596516" id="a0001596516-mark"><sup>1</sup></a> of $R$ over $S$ is the $S/\mathfrak m_ S$-vector space $\mathfrak m_ S/(\mathfrak m_ R S + \mathfrak m_ S^2)$. </p>
</article>